      `, `src.utils.runtime_logger`, `src.display.get_bar`, and four `src.phase3` siblings. None of them touch `src.a
      nalysis.*`. Conversely, `src.analysis.*` modules import only `src.schemas.*` — no phase3 runtime types.
  344 3. **Phase 4 is correctly dataset-only at the type level.** Neither `src/phase4/report_narrative.py` nor `src/p
      hase4/report_agent.py` imports anything from `src.phase3.*` or `src.analysis.*`. Their only "phase 3-ish" knowl
      edge is via dict-key access on the supplied `simulation_dataset`. `parse_llm_report_response` literally does `d
      el response` to document that the LLM response is no longer consumed (line 190 of `report_agent.py`).
