      src.llm_client import LLMClient` inside method bodies rather than at module top. The top-of-file import is `fro
      m src.llm_client import get_llm_client` (not the class). This is intentional (per-instantiation parameter varia
      tion) but worth noting — the module reads `llm_event_entity = LLMClient(temperature=0.3, ...)` and `llm_spreade
      r = LLMClient(temperature=0.8, ...)` at line 233 and 235 respectively.
